{"l":4328,"g":6,"b":1,"cefr":"A2","role":"reinforcement","insight":"conceptual_bridge","k":"l","variant":"authored","q":"Læs: 'My grandmother is eighty, but she still rides her bike to the shops every day.' Hvad er overraskende ved bedstemoren?","o":["Hun har aldrig haft en cykel.","Hun cykler stadig hver dag.","Hun bor over en butik.","Hun er under firs år."],"a":"Hun cykler stadig hver dag.","r":"Hun er firs år, men 'she still rides her bike', hun cykler stadig."},
