{"l":6688,"g":7,"b":4,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"g","variant":"authored","q":"Hvilket ord passer: 'My aunt, ___ lives in Aarhus, is a doctor.'","o":["which","that","who","whose"],"a":"who","r":"Om personer bruger man 'who'. 'That' kan ikke bruges, når der står komma om sætningen."},
