{"l":6728,"g":7,"b":4,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"l","variant":"authored","q":"Læs: 'Unless more people start using the bus, the route through our village will be cut next year. Everyone has been asked to give it a try.' Hvorfor bliver folk bedt om at tage bussen?","o":["For at redde busruten","For at spare penge","Fordi bussen er ny","Fordi vejene er lukket"],"a":"For at redde busruten","r":"Hvis ikke flere tager bussen, forsvinder ruten. 'Unless' betyder medmindre."},
